5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's keep this simple. We need to find the wolf. I'll be watching your reactions closely to see who's trying too hard to blend in.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe we should remain calm and listen to one another carefully before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! Let's work together and be honest so we can find the werewolf quickly!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need to be told how to find a wolf. I'll do it my way, and I'm not letting any of you trick me.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I hope we can all maintain a sense of peace while we navigate this difficult situation together.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, your enthusiasm is a bit loud. It's a classic way to hide nervousness. Or perhaps you're just that naive?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, Shunichi, let's not be too harsh. It is early. I think it's better to observe how everyone speaks over the next few turns.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Oh, I'm just happy! But @Shunichi, I'll show you I'm serious about helping the village! We should share any clues we find immediately!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop arguing about ""vibes"" and ""enthusiasm."" It's annoying. If you're going to be useless, just stay out of my way.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Perhaps a bit of silence would allow us to think more clearly. There is wisdom in listening more than speaking.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, silence is a luxury the werewolf loves. If we all stay quiet, the wolf just blends into the background. I prefer a bit of noise.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"I see both points. However, I tend to trust a steady flow of information. Let us see who contradicts themselves as the days pass.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with George! If we talk more, the werewolf might make a mistake! I'll be paying very close attention to everyone!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Why are you all acting like you're so smart? I'm the one who's actually paying attention here. Just stop talking in circles!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I understand. I will simply observe and offer my thoughts when I feel they might be helpful to the group.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,Fair enough. Let's see what the Seer finds tonight. I'll be analyzing your patterns tomorrow. Try not to be too obvious.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established our positions. I will rely on the evidence provided tomorrow to make my judgment.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Good luck to the Seer! I hope we get a great lead tomorrow morning! Let's all do our best for the village!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Whatever. I'm over this. Just don't come crying to me when you vote for the wrong person tomorrow.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. Let us hope for a clear path forward tomorrow.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
