32,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, the sun is up. Who has something interesting to tell us? Or are we still playing the ""peaceful"" game?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"I am listening. If anyone has information that can help us identify the enemy, please share it with us now.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, listen! I'm the Seer! I checked George last night, and he is definitely human! We can trust him!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! You just blurted it out? That's the stupidest thing I've ever heard! You just put a target on your own back!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That was quite a bold move, Yumi. I wonder if such openness is a sign of truth or a calculated strategy.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, claiming Seer on Day 1 is a high-risk play. Either you're a very honest Villager, or you're the Werewolf trying to secure George's trust.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"I am honored by your trust, Yumi. While I am cautious, your willingness to reveal yourself so early is quite striking.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I just want us to win! If we know George is safe, we only have to worry about the other three! Isn't that helpful?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, why are you always questioning everyone? You're acting like you're the only one who knows how to play this game! It's irritating!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is interesting to see the tension rising. Perhaps we should consider if Yumi's claim is too convenient for the village.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your irritation is a fascinating defense mechanism. You're attacking me because you can't find a logical flaw in my reasoning.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"Let us focus. If Yumi is the Seer, we have a reliable ally. If she is the wolf, she is trying to manipulate me. I will remain neutral.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm really the Seer! Please believe me! @Takumi, you've been really aggressive since the start. Are you trying to hide something?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Shut up! I'm not hiding anything! I'm just sick of you all acting like you're better than me! I'm not the wolf!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Aggression can be a mask, but so can kindness. It is difficult to discern the truth when emotions are so high.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Logic dictates that if Yumi is lying, she's the wolf or possessed. But if she's the wolf, she's too exposed. I suspect Takumi's volatility.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,"I find Takumi's behavior unsettling, but I cannot ignore the possibility that Yumi is playing a game. However, I lean toward Takumi.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I really think it's Takumi! He's been so mean to everyone, and he's trying to distract us from my information! Let's vote him out!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,You're all just ganging up on me because I'm not pretending to be your friend! This is a joke! I'm not going down like this!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I will follow the consensus of the group. If the majority feels Takumi is the threat, I cannot disagree without reason.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
